[Shake]Mario you're idiotic![/fx][BR]
Who the heck goes around[BR]
riding on birds?[BR]
[Wait][Next]
I'd give it rizz points, but[BR]
we're not in battle right now,[BR]
so that's illegal.[BR]
[Wait][End]
}

